ication metadata for `PMID:40475517` and `PMID:35320732`; `PMID:35320732` supports the NCSE2-1/NCSE2-2 related synonyms and progenitor interpretation.\n- Used Uberon search results for `fallopian tube epithelium` (`UBERON:8600124`) in the logical definition.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `robot convert -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/cl-edit-issue-3196.ofn`\n- `robot reason --reasoner ELK -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/cl-edit-issue-3196-reasoned.ofn`\n- `git diff --check -- src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`\n\nAll validation commands completed successfully.\n\nSigned-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
